sequenceDiagram
        autonumber
        actor User
        participant Page as Web Page (Content Script)
        participant SW as Background Service Worker
        participant Offscreen as Offscreen Document (AI Worker)
        participant DB as IndexedDB (Local Storage)
        participant SidePanel as Side Panel UI (React)

        User->>Page: Visits article / clicks "Index Page"
        Page->>Page: Run Mozilla Readability & split into text chunks
        Page->>SW: chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: "INDEX_PAGE", data })
        SW->>DB: Save raw article metadata & chunks (status: "pending_embeddings")
        SW->>SW: Ensure Offscreen Document exists
        SW->>Offscreen: chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: "GENERATE_EMBEDDINGS", chunks })
        Offscreen->>Offscreen: Run @xenova/transformers (all-MiniLM-L6-v2) via WebGPU/WASM
        Offscreen->>SW: Return 384-dimensional vectors
        SW->>DB: Save vectors to IndexedDB chunks store
        SW->>SidePanel: chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: "PAGE_INDEXED", pageId })

        Note over User,SidePanel: User searches in Side Panel
        User->>SidePanel: Types query: "Rust memory management"
        SidePanel->>SW: chrome.runtime.sendMessage({ type: "SEARCH", query })
        SW->>Offscreen: Generate embedding for query
        Offscreen-->>SW: Query vector
        SW->>DB: Load stored vectors & compute Cosine Similarity
        SW-->>SidePanel: Ranked matching pages & highlighted snippets
        SidePanel-->>User: Displays clickable results